  "description": "The child of a prophecy is born to save the world. *\"I need to get married to save people...? I'll do the marriage!\"* The emperor is a young and innocent boy. But... My father interfered with my marriage! *\"I can't give you my daughter! She will not be becoming empress.\"* *\"Is my sister just a toy to you?\"* And my brother too! \n\nWill I be able to save the world? \n\n**Note:** This is a one-shot promotional manhwa for the novel of the same name.",
